cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper and this archive."
title: "Analysis code for: CXCR3 on transferred T cells enables vaccine-boosted adoptive T-cell therapy in solid tumors"
abstract: >-
  R and Python code used to generate the figures of Pereira Almeida et al.,
  covering single-cell RNA-sequencing of the vaccine-draining lymph node,
  bulk RNA-sequencing of B16F10-OVA tumours, spectral flow cytometry
  clustering, and reanalysis of the public datasets GSE307143 and GSE121861.
type: software
license: MIT
